<title>HUNGARY: CIB Hungaria reduces prime rate to 22.875 pct.</title>
<headline>CIB Hungaria reduces prime rate to 22.875 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's CIB Hungaria Bank Rt said on Friday it would cut its prime lending rate on forint loans to 22.875 percent from 23.75 percent, effective December 16.</p>
<p>The current 23.75 percent rate has been effective since October 1.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327-4040</p>
